g  since we don't know the details of where  this is going on or who set it up I know  there's a popular theory out there that  everything we've seen from Maeve is in  the simulation like she's never been  outside of a simulation I don't think  that's true I think that when she had  her face off with a Yakuza that was in  the real world  part of the reason I think that is  because that was part of the reveal that  Dolores was in all the pearls and those  scenes were shown at the normal aspect  ratio a couple other scenes we see that  are interesting there's a flashback  scene of Teddy and Dolores where she's  wearing her blue dress on horseback in  the park I do believe this is probably a  flashback there's a shot of Charlotte  fighting with someone this isn't a  character I recognize I have a feeling  that it is a security guard and it's  connected to this next shot that we see  of the riot control robot where it's  smashing through a wall to crush a  security guard wearing the same  clothes this isn't one of the guys that  was walking behind some rock when we saw  him so I'm gonna go with dello security  but it's not clear why Charlotte is  fighting against them the closing shot  of the trailer is Caleb walking towards  the camera with an angry look on his  face and the voiceover we hear Dolores  say we're survivors this is probably  connected to when Ciroc puts the gun to  his head the background is blurry it  kind of resembles a host printing  machine which could be pointing to the  fact that this is in the park but I  don't feel confident to say that for  sure so some of the big questions that  come to mind after watching this which  Dolores is in the simulation with Maeve  it seems unlikely that that would be  Dolores prime that could be an  indication that Ciroc recovered the  pearl that was inside Martin Connells  which detonated the bomb at the inside  headquarters or that he has captured one  of the other ones it could be the one  that's inside Hale since 